  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0901bb83813f439e449165c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻松松，下次的第1名！我也会拿下的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8def2a8a589602b0e19f5313c0efc5f94684da10c2cdd589433aae5a7f337e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2bf04e67a8ac9b673d246da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これにて終幕！\r\nまさに神業、だったでしょ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f7dc2ac031375e4b73b6af7da4a433b0df3a86604badd6e06f3ba1589c1a229",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30206"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:155b95f0abd8a55fbf3abff3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轻轻松松，下次的第1名！我也会拿下的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8def2a8a589602b0e19f5313c0efc5f94684da10c2cdd589433aae5a7f337e42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "30207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faf894939154379c7d645d77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1517fbd3c7a4b1a9bc6c0f2a21ca4dcc3ad0db20e4ce267cdba0767e3af1e843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e870aaca4dc686c0ce972933",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赢家肯定是我，帝王大人哒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30a4a53a3e2e689ba772203bf68ac59989b59e4b440ef4dd9e218ac116c5e33c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a89ccef9696b805efd5d104",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走るのってホンットにキモチイイ！\r\nこれからもたっくさん、みんなに\r\nカッコいいところ見せるぞ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5314b4ca18f8f542d2539ffce9ec54ec9850e9b0f76b0c53b0200bf40bfb95a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345337fd56581ce1e743c4e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ボクが強い理由？\r\nへへ、それは…\r\nヒミツ♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "912dc2ef795c60a86a49b5617eeb61ec8cf82c36628c3c71d007b762b28e5475",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1033542716f38be06e4ee65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管是比赛或舞蹈，\r\n赢家的宝座都是我的！\r\n这才是帝王大人，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "233373e5a040d6078e4dc6a6dfefb367273af579e0dc866de607961b71ad36e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d2bfb4a5e35e49284f7f7b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正式上场的服装是很帅气\r\n没错啦……嗳～麦昆。至少\r\n蝴蝶结让我绑松一点好不好～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a6c4718562887c8fdff9a6a0c7bf156fd5cc2ab4f739559bc47355a6f8db3dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaef11664112083b96575a55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标当然是让所有人\r\n都能开心的完美结局啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "721bf66b4aed4623310e4f6fddaa2fe7a88dbde56150c019efd02244f529bbd0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10cad2a29cdcaf9ed09a9f2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "究——极！无敌的——！嘿！帝王舞步哒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f81d8071b073729de17839c762ee3f84795c094de7bd9f218e580112382cfb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e6a8c487b42e39a0501c039",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すごい熱気だった…\r\nきっと、歴代で1番だ。…絶対に。\r\n――見てたか、シンボリルドルフ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a21ca414a5f699d9aa99a6aacee160776779d3ff52b81f28d5aeb50164e8d6c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7ed992a62bcdf47628ff095",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欢迎来到活动任务。\r\n看来……你不需要我的领导啊。\r\n……嘻嘻嘻，加油哦～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "50550f893498676b01f4cf10611f4e298e83fa4ac8a7b72ed81b0f9258f6c322",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6a0f5581e8d8a244cc0b154",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。\r\n帝王大人来称赞你的努力～\r\n尽管收下奖励吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d9aaae985f6b0d9e31f286a232be9e28b8f996281a2d3866a9d920660a9cca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c6b0c08b5ec86e0b0ca8303",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝对要赢——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6096e4ebe68fc27f2f6a93935da80b335e676150475d56f5b6ae37487156627",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88a87350de3ed078654d8589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "她们三人一起拍的广告真是帅气！\r\n广告里有拍到几处街景对吧？\r\n好想快点实际去玩玩喔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1d1a5b0401724add52dceafd2b95be30b0e4419b07f9c02b1849ca9e27e42cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f23759c38b6e2d477b367aa5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……用这股力量的话……！\r\n哈啊啊啊啊！帝王传说从这开始——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "112b4c2990d676d373108b873f3f674db0e4a26a76a49ef1006a2979369bb421",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45244b95df93fc62c8dda89e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カイチョーの後を継ぐのはボク！\r\nカイチョーを超えるのもボク！\r\n誰にも譲らないもんね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a50ce0679d08fd1149635a43267daec4129677ea3896034ac0d654737d1c00f6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "400061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab6475480f46c8b08ef44c95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "テイオーの舞い、ご照覧あれ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf08b66ad8e311ea38eadec109f9272f2383223a757809f55b8cbbc7184d4ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40203"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab51cbd8c659c93c04327994",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "流麗に舞う胡蝶にして、\r\nその早駆けは旋風の如し――\r\nどう？ボクに見とれちゃった？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f35fc728fb2212d513141e7b599015f3fd175ecdfab2b620474fe80e8644d1d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "40204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76ec60654cf13efc5254d04b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上啰──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12061afd2ebc3e8665a88908d6a82610379b1355c7d6cacc914896b1be3e2fb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b98e13e029ccbd6b8a84da2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太棒了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7d8f20cc956a8d520b2af7240c22e9b3d9150c1ad2835de85b9a4cf4eab1a44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e010aa942440692a5a870f3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0976cd6841156d248a388b0c35447ec43110d4297195e6c6cd3b149e0a42f7fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dfccd2e961d349c3419e0c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶──耶──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0976cd6841156d248a388b0c35447ec43110d4297195e6c6cd3b149e0a42f7fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:146feab542468d42ca6e0da2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db5ada8caa756d2328205c6fde19074b56213baaec8e7fdffa129f28ec54ddb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d4d608f3dac4b8a4f59c547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "耶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7db5ada8caa756d2328205c6fde19074b56213baaec8e7fdffa129f28ec54ddb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e102ccde0daf4a41d5f63fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e88e313ab43fde0753eff84b849b3f2ebf0fe875805c0f539cc16b75745c9f1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b181a7cd3dad6d907a8d54f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e88e313ab43fde0753eff84b849b3f2ebf0fe875805c0f539cc16b75745c9f1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2198ed63dd557786f6ef20ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e88e313ab43fde0753eff84b849b3f2ebf0fe875805c0f539cc16b75745c9f1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "410008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:971b17ba99c35e5b5037b3c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是Live！诶嘿嘿，要开始享受了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ad7b41eed4a8cdf7a66489450e58eae8ecf212121ffb165da4e601ac69cc21a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7d774a9e809a0e92da67673",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绝～对不要看漏了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "378026098a7b90bb29b764d0e825a92ee60bffaf962cd2fc31b255a4f2a72c53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2cfb3a68238b809c6477613",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要以“帝王”为目标，加油了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "855c065061b37aa5409ca9b49f2bed223d03903a92cf00f3ec4efa17457f9220",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9457b495ce825e031d929ab3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今以后也多多指教了，训练员！\r\n毕竟要实现无敌的帝王传说的话，\r\n可不能没有你啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1956704cc257d217e34ffb3dec9b16701a49241948fa3c3ba661cd91ecff851a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2da6be56f14de95dbd75e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～哼，看上去就像是优等生吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd7025f68f6cfeb4e1c191edb61d419738d0e23a0d516262daebdc0bcf579da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff728a37e7a49933db9afea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵！又帅又可爱对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3a4dd83407cbb2e9b24f056a89d84e41127c5d891f7dbe35f376546d431997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22e95128b50d57543bcd27dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王大人，参上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77f70c9b2b5e36e2e73365f67e4956da806fe8de09d1ce1b85700c960c1f13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c51f97ae8d02b9fa5e6992",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和会长同款的衣服！虽然肯定是一样的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0536a7443ca82535263d2c95a9137d3f0ab9b388ae1c81672c822efabf3aa0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69e02f47c13bf9042800c87c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我肯定会站在C位，所以就好好期待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df7d500476a138d27b44139f8c71f93670bf42ac7b6e2ec170517f81f899383",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4eeed61128a45c9c7e922284",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会穿着这件决胜服，赢下比赛给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24194de1ab959555b891e3a34283369ba17a169c591eb854d4f03e397435e951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75f2efea9137ed9283888e3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快～看！是件与最强的我\r\n十分相称的决胜服对吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20fd35e1faf5c8ef25a5e396c6b94baba67dd2d60d8781b794f2710fde10f626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5867a2b804dce89b5ff6bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶哟、小心点哦。\r\n要是碰到的话会被烫伤也说不定哦～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7aea033b8f74161f408e57d410574972a94d4e56bcd394b2e6c44afb5195827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e44c1f56730c214205ee3e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真帅气啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94482b9b921bdbc6b57a3ce486bbf333fff987de4c6c4261760a19a5ae77ad5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef6ac362c74dd18e1175eadf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是无敌的帝王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d32d2961298e018f06060ef43f0fe12d2d5d158bd0850028004859b67cacfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04b6f4a100c5f65ab564979e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼哼～?\r\n这可是帝王大人的私人生活照喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1199cbad9496a6718125dd033c3ef5f6788cb9c599c5fa013ee35e9482b7cc1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a060724f280d31d3acbc1751",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～我说啊～快点出去走走嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6080161f21d4fc033ffaa50da66decce53df80e211d1586495bfe02e12cd365",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5654bfeb2c11272d643ad0a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とっておきの舞い、\r\n見せちゃうからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6d487d8b391c2ba9bbc7d44d477b467fec06d380888e2eab9da0b0bfdc315f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6b975adb116e8215c9b219d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この袖、触ってみる？\r\nすべすべして気持ちいいんだ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3551dc881f8c086c680eb4f739efc718f6795666b4639d5ff47f9229ef53f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7acb47be5ad5e50fde7bf5f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯～哼，看上去就像是优等生吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1dd7025f68f6cfeb4e1c191edb61d419738d0e23a0d516262daebdc0bcf579da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4b90f207d62e8fd0d72f9b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "锵！又帅又可爱对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b3a4dd83407cbb2e9b24f056a89d84e41127c5d891f7dbe35f376546d431997",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f32c05296339416afc0732f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无敌的帝王大人，参上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c77f70c9b2b5e36e2e73365f67e4956da806fe8de09d1ce1b85700c960c1f13b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e59b71ffbdbdbe6b63cfd69a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和会长同款的衣服！虽然肯定是一样的就是了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0536a7443ca82535263d2c95a9137d3f0ab9b388ae1c81672c822efabf3aa0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e458bc93704b39a69f37d7c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我肯定会站在C位，所以就好好期待吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5df7d500476a138d27b44139f8c71f93670bf42ac7b6e2ec170517f81f899383",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081579850ee0b0cb166748b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会穿着这件决胜服，赢下比赛给你看的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24194de1ab959555b891e3a34283369ba17a169c591eb854d4f03e397435e951",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7cfbd2654d0935cd0b70a47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快看快～看！是件与最强的我\r\n十分相称的决胜服对吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "20fd35e1faf5c8ef25a5e396c6b94baba67dd2d60d8781b794f2710fde10f626",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41d0a66583f6bb85d1a8f400",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶哟、小心点哦。\r\n要是碰到的话会被烫伤也说不定哦～？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7aea033b8f74161f408e57d410574972a94d4e56bcd394b2e6c44afb5195827",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:217dd8a5bb6e248a7a6ca3dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真帅气啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94482b9b921bdbc6b57a3ce486bbf333fff987de4c6c4261760a19a5ae77ad5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f52c90ca51edcc6ef45b2cc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我正是无敌的帝王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d32d2961298e018f06060ef43f0fe12d2d5d158bd0850028004859b67cacfc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98a71ef0a53509afe853a3fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とっておきの舞い、\r\n見せちゃうからね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6d487d8b391c2ba9bbc7d44d477b467fec06d380888e2eab9da0b0bfdc315f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddbff9cb5e5578b9f27113e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この袖、触ってみる？\r\nすべすべして気持ちいいんだ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3551dc881f8c086c680eb4f739efc718f6795666b4639d5ff47f9229ef53f98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbfda4190e3dc75ecb39d2d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf1ec80ee5b1719727a30762",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼～哼！我帝王大人，\r\n接受你的挑战！",
      "source_fingerprint": "373ce2b520eb0f9d089e9a5fe7f0e9ede3075599c6fd9443f6a478a9fa86516a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ead2e5f365d699915ed554b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对手越强的话我的斗志就越熊熊燃烧～！\r\n虽然赢的人肯定是我就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32a1ced2651a2a5a95775abec37c4a0f19ca38589e20aa86dc343ee06297505",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ea59edd7fb93ebe9ad85528",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好——！\r\n向着无敌的三冠赛马娘的目标，\r\n今天也要加油咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63d4763b4e74f79ddf1aa10dd4e1f0ecaea345d57e33649285963b4bf67b88b6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fcb4a712b38f89fa3008583",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咳咳，在场的各位！\r\n帝王大人要进校了，\r\n快快把路让～开！……开玩笑♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1afb9b592eeb2a70531104eea2dea2d55f2c8e76cd562df6b09ebbdb9d8cb06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:172426f64a4775b9b0e806cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚才呢，来了次突击测试……\r\n但班上只有我是满分！\r\n不愧是我！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0501879566b7167938bdbf6039744bd0fec5518d3ae06a2f611e2560eb737d34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fa0c9135f9930bbaa6d91f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐——，见到会长了没？哎～，\r\n我还以为今天一定能在一起吃午饭呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fa71db6d9a41676b1847a78ecfdad9cd6bc98ae114bb79679b0eeba47773282",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4ae15e24ff6e7a8b0d28dda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，辛苦了。\r\n嗯嗯，今天你也为了我辛苦付出了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "05d85d046b5a2d50d05203bd877a0ceb212a369a020f563cb04b22169a24ffce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20761a1ae99d75aa29a58f8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员这个时间点也要外出？\r\n我呢，身体运动还不够，\r\n所以一直在闲逛呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "46995f12035833bd8f7fddc2dd4d2116f3a00c74df9b43da950fe80bb779fd91",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc154984a8a1182733073437",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噗噗——\r\n只有会长当新生的对手真无聊！\r\n明明让我来也没关系的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f922982df4c0857b9d4250dac6233cf4fb140c7205178dffac3619c90cefed69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724531d69c145a1cbfd41971",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐～！超强的独角仙，\r\n一起出发去抓吧！\r\n黄金船也有着呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "256e731acb4b361dd6e7fce60c109b4b6a4e1c469dfd0deacfcb32591f63e03e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9af4f0271f8ea6dba7aca102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员也来试试走在落叶上吧？\r\n听着沙沙的声音轻响，\r\n心情很棒吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "399b8ae09c977b89c180deb0fa1054d52103e41e2426eb16a3f4b7dfe16ac83d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7831233fee7e9adfc9f00200",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近可真冷啊。\r\n啊——啊，都这样了，\r\n等雪积起来就可以尽情玩耍了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2e94296b0486c5fc83390d5530adc0b649eb94e9a50230ec57c98f19d94b97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0007d244f9f5f4a14604c0e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～……\r\n开玩笑要和麦昆一起……\r\n不过从早上开始就要认真了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49d3955cff07f8ad4b5e07ad7693dd26fa82b46bc428a71faea0696db56d6ef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:979a3358f71448afa8696706",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "蜂蜜～蜂蜜～蜂蜜～♪\r\n果然早上的话，\r\n就是要蜂蜜特饮呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb5d666c94953006bc94228b8d9f1482e7401ae691ac0b35fe1ee658d7ade8b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6e890eb5ca30c239b4969df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呐呐，听我说哦！我中午\r\n去后辈们的教室露了一下脸\r\n结果被要签名了呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82790aa22560e278f594b3d24b39dc78118504e4a744853bb612d6d655a1605",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85be3fb5a87776dda9ab1c30",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈～啊……吃完午饭之后真的\r\n会觉得很困啊～……要不去\r\n学生会办公室稍微睡会好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0898f74f6106145fec1c87fbe82ea445ffc80ef3398c5cad6aee04a8875a3c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06295ce745d046311dac96f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了我忙到这么晚真是辛苦了！\r\n我会好好回应这份感情的，\r\n你就尽请期待吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2905e3d043f066de4387e5373cc0a174183612ae63aa4b8aa6f5a224373c5477",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef7ba00e43ca4824238deb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "后辈们都好好地回来了吗——\r\n哼哼♪像这样子关心她们也是\r\n前辈的工作♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ff1051ceeadce3976ffe287f84124335ff5ac783febaad049584973897fd89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a5e84ee0d489685747ee3c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "皋月赏之后就是德比……春季的比赛\r\n真是一个接着一个！嘛，不管哪场比赛\r\n赢的人都会是我就是了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d412516941bbab68bd1dcab885eb1c1af898531452585caa889d276ce73ee05f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa3f2e055c9aeac6bd9cd930",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉和大家还有一段距离……\r\n是因为衣服太热了吗？\r\n嘻嘻！追上来喽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "54daa7f9768a5b45bc48d4434c7be0d82600240914a9016a87286ab91f8410ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1003",
        "90017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
